	<content contentuid="h6cb66037g350dg411agab0bgf9fab1338dd6" version="1">Elemental Affinity: Additional Force Damage</content>
	<content contentuid="hc4bb88e2gf06fg4025gbb1cgfb992c138396" version="1">At Level 6, spells that deal Force damage are more powerful, and you can become resistant to Force damage.</content>

	<content contentuid="h2860ce5dgfbbfg4244g998eg6ce924688d04" version="1">Elemental Affinity: Additional Radiant Damage</content>
	<content contentuid="h492a7b7dg19e8g400dg9b85g16a2e3f8e683" version="1">At Level 6, spells that deal Radiant damage are more powerful, and you can become resistant to Radiant damage.</content>

	<content contentuid="h4cedbaacgd7d5g4029ga04fg8236dc129d10" version="1">Elemental Affinity: Additional Psychic Damage</content>
	<content contentuid="h02457d43ge292g452cgb447gdbff2fce9820" version="1">At Level 6, spells that deal Psychic damage are more powerful, and you can become resistant to Psychic damage.</content>

	<content contentuid="h2efa997ag8226g4e9bgb338g3c32d7f843e8" version="1">Elemental Affinity: Additional Thunder Damage</content>
	<content contentuid="h510e7170gbf76g4befg80a4g5728cf47cf77" version="1">At Level 6, spells that deal Thunder damage are more powerful, and you can become resistant to Thunder damage.</content>

	<content contentuid="h43b3bd6bgb34dg4ef6gbfb9g5121bfbab3ed" version="1">Elemental Affinity: Additional Necrotic Damage</content>
	<content contentuid="h7e261999g7ac3g452agad44g12b6e8f0ef68" version="1">At Level 6, spells that deal Necrotic damage are more powerful, and you can become resistant to Psychic damage.</content>


	<content contentuid="h01fb6f21g2e60g4621ga8e1g95d8373a8629" version="1">Elemental Affinity: Force Resistance</content>
	<content contentuid="hf458b4b6g5d4cg400dga4efge0035d884c1a" version="1">You are &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;Resistant&lt;/LSTag&gt; to Force damage.</content>

