	<content contentuid="h6d1123b8g773cg4fefg95d7g78d864f5f04f" version="1">You are &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;Resistant&lt;/LSTag&gt; to Radiant damage.</content>

	<content contentuid="h3d8da66fg0b00g4741gbaf1g11493e334a29" version="1">Elemental Affinity: Psychic Resistance</content>
	<content contentuid="h112ca36dge0edg46d7g95d7g4792a5a8c1ed" version="1">You are &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;Resistant&lt;/LSTag&gt; to Psychic damage.</content>

	<content contentuid="h34c7e4c5g7455g45dbgb4abg4fd5b2e0ec99" version="1">Elemental Affinity: Necrotic Resistance</content>
	<content contentuid="hbc23fb01gcfe3g4184ga99ag2ed192e32512" version="1">You are &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;Resistant&lt;/LSTag&gt; to Necrotic damage.</content>

	<content contentuid="h112a7f50g3634g4956g9148gf980f7507714" version="1">Elemental Affinity: Thunder Resistance</content>
	<content contentuid="hc0b82ba2g4945g40f2gbb2cg15373b63fc55" version="1">You are &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;Resistant&lt;/LSTag&gt; to Thunder damage.</content>

	<content contentuid="h1661fbfcgc84bg4a50g926fgc691443273e0" version="1">Dragon-like scales cover parts of your skin. When you aren't wearing armour, your add your Charisma &lt;LSTag Tooltip="AbilityModifier"&gt;Modifier&lt;/LSTag&gt; to your &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ArmourClass"&gt;Armour Class&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
	<content contentuid="h3de9cbfbg99a9g413cgbc2bg91b52ff3b536" version="1">Gain &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Resistant"&gt;Resistance&lt;/LSTag&gt; to the damage type associated with your draconic ancestry.</content>

	<content contentuid="he4dae88ag5107g448bgbb11g344c4e3ab6f0" version="1">They Were The Footprints of a Gigantic Hound</content>
	<content contentuid="h4d49dfc0ged2fg4357gb7ebg5ea87e0a2f27" version="1">...of Ill Omen</content>

	<content contentuid="h1c3e6087g5557g4936g8777g5f997baba3f8" version="1">From the Shadows</content>
	<content contentuid="ha30f8318g635dg4949gb888g8ea62c1c7290" version="1">You deal an extra [1] with Psychic spells, or any spell cast while you're within &lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_Darkness"&gt;Darkness&lt;/LSTag&gt;. You deal an extra [2] with Necrotic spells, or any spell cast on targets within &lt;LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_Darkness"&gt;Darkness&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

	<content contentuid="h0cfe6ad8gda46g4060gaff5g407f697a2972" version="1">The Shadow Within</content>
	<content contentuid="he8f53777g5947g4671g88ffg0481fee79849" version="1">Both damage bonuses of &lt;LSTag Type="Passive" Tooltip="FromTheShadows"&gt;From The Shadows&lt;/LSTag&gt; are always applied to your Psychic and Necrotic spells.</content>

	
	<content contentuid="h3118e76egea54g4720ga4b6g44b9f380c29e" version="1">Spells that cost an action cost a bonus action instead. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Costs [1] Sorcery Points per spell, or [2] per cantrip.</content>

	<content contentuid="h975ac7f2g1755g490dg8d32ge2ad008d2fd1" version="1">Standard Magic</content>
	<content contentuid="hcd3bd1d9g7a86g4ffbg9fa6gd08747ed217f" version="1">Your powers come from ancient forces of order. They churn within you - waiting to burst free at times of your choosing.</content>
