	<content contentuid="h9ff64755g3229g430cg9050g8ff0e3b1493f" version="1">Choose a Standard Magic spell to add to your repertoire.</content>
	<content contentuid="hdba7f743g9537g4204gb70fgeb40a98c1e90" version="1">Gain 1 Sorcery Point.</content>
	<content contentuid="hd9ef2d7eg3e4bg4456gb82eg184c639e9a32" version="1">Regain 1 Sorcery Point after a &lt;LSTag Tooltip="ShortRest"&gt;Short Rest&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

