	<content contentuid="h0a34d5dag8e11g43b6g8551g5cd78b90aa3c" version="1">Teleport up to [1]. For 2 turns, you can teleport again as a &lt;LSTag Type="ActionResource" Tooltip="BonusActionPoint"&gt;bonus action&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

