	<content contentuid="h21816a2cgb738g4170gaddagfd9b6d1d2048" version="1">The next weapon attack deals an additional [1] and is a guaranteed &lt;LSTag Tooltip="CriticalHit"&gt;Critical Hit&lt;/LSTag&gt;. Usable once per &lt;LSTag Tooltip="LongRest"&gt;Long Rest&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>
