	<content contentuid="hc7cd3716gf1f5g4b33g8cd9g957ac6999ca5" version="1">The weapon deals an additional [1] until &lt;LSTag Tooltip="LongRest"&gt;Long Rest&lt;/LSTag&gt;.</content>

